ier new'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;\"\u003e\"\u003ci style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eurl\u003c/i\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Consolas, 'courier new'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highATT\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: red; font-family: Consolas, 'courier new'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;\"\u003ealt=\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highVAL\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: mediumblue; font-family: Consolas, 'courier new'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;\"\u003e\"\u003ci style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003esome_text\u003c/i\u003e\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"highGT\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: blue; font-family: Consolas, 'courier new'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22.4px;\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1452309670},{"id":268625,"author":"Cynthesis","body":"\u0026lt;a href=\"url\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;img src=\"image.png, jpg, gif, whatever\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;, I believe. I'm going off of memory here, tho.","body_tagged":"\u0026lt;a href=\"url\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;img src=\"image.png, jpg, gif, whatever\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;, I believe. I'm going off of memory here, tho.","created_at":1452360688},{"id":268632,"author":"AtditC","body":"You first gotta upload it to a server like imgur, gyazo etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eLittle tutorial (for Google Chrome):\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#0000ee\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\" title=\"Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRight click on your picture and go on: Copy image address (for Google Chrome)\u003cbr\u003eAnd now you can put the copied URL into the URL of this HTML example code:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026lt;img src=\"URL\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/img\u0026gt;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edon't forget to leave the \" there where they are.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExample Image:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/tVYFNZx.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/tVYFNZx.png\"\u003e","body_tagged":"You first gotta upload it to a server like imgur, gyazo etc.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eLittle tutorial (for Google Chrome):\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#0000ee\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\" title=\"Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o3ZNgf98Dnk\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRight click on your picture and go on: Copy image address (for Google Chrome)\u003cbr\u003eAnd now you can put the copied URL into the URL of this HTML example code:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026lt;img src=\"URL\"\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/img\u0026gt;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edon't forget to leave the \" there where they are.\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExample Image:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/tVYFNZx.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/tVYFNZx.png\"\u003e","created_at":1452362243},{"id":268634,"author":"AtditC","body":"\u0026lt;a\u0026gt; is going to make a text (between \u0026lt;a\u0026gt; and \u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;) clickable. It's redirecting you to another website which you put in href=\"url\".","body_tagged":"\u0026lt;a\u0026gt; is going to make a text (between \u0026lt;a\u0026gt; and \u0026lt;/a\u0026gt;) clickable. It's redirecting you to another website which you put in href=\"url\".","created_at":1452362834,"reply_to":268625},{"id":268647,"author":"Cynthesis","body":"So, in other words, just put the \"href\" in the \u0026lt;img src\u0026gt; tag?","body_tagged":"So, in other words, just put the \"href\" in the \u0026lt;img src\u0026gt; tag?","created_at":1452364639,"reply_to":268634},{"id":268651,"author":"AtditC","body":"No href at all","body_tagged":"No href at all","created_at":1452366044,"reply_to":268647}]}